a looks around and takes in her surroundings."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_wind_grass","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The fountain in the center of the garden remains faithful to its post, spewing jets of water up into the air tirelessly. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"The golden statue of a goddess on the fountain peers down coldly at Erma from her high perch as she slinks past."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Erma turns to look behind her, but nobody is there. Stevens M520 is still only talking to her via the comms channel. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"The villa itself is still silent and motionless. She is certain that the garden is unoccupied save for herself and the unfriendly-looking scouts."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Erma","expression":23,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Erma","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Why don't you show yourself?","style":{"color":"#66CDAA"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I've followed your instructions and made my way here.","style":{"color":"#66CDAA"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Erma","expression":23,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC_Stevens520","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Stevens M520","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"If I showed myself now, you'd bound over like an excited puppy and start comparing heights with me, getting dirt all over my dress in the process.","style":{"color":"#66CDAA"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"All just to satisfy your stupid curiosity.","style":{"color":"#66CDAA"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I have no more patience for your nonsense.","style":{"color":"#66CDAA"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Erma","expression":17,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC_Stevens520","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Erma","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"How did you know?","style":{"color":"#66CDAA"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Erma","expression":17,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC_Stevens520","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Stevens M520","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Just speaking from experience.","style":{"color":"#66CDAA"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Erma","expression":24,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC_Stevens520","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Erma","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I promise I won't.","style":{"color":"#66CDAA"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Erma","expression":24,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC_Stevens520","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Stevens M520","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You never keep your promises, except to Doctor Hume.","style":{"color":"#66CDAA"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Erma","expression":23,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC_Stevens520","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Erma","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You seem to know me very well.","style":{"color":"#66CDAA"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_Stevens520","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Stevens M520","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"If I got to choose, I'd rather not know you at all.","style":{"color":"#66CDAA"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"It's been quite a few years, Erma. Let me see how much you've grown.","style":{"color":"#66CDAA"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_Team_Running","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The scouts standing around the garden suddenly lunge towards Erma."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_Grey_Hand_Mech","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Even more strange mechanical monstrosities from further away start gathering in this direction. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Much to Erma's surprise, one of the approaching Doll Dummies is armed with an Erma Maschinenpistole."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Erma","expression":17,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":"Erma","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Why do you have my Dummy...?","style":{"color":"#66CDAA"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC_Stevens520","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Stevens M520","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"There are questions that I've already answered countless times before you even ask them.","style":{"color":"#66CDAA"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"fadePointOn","raw":"黑点1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]}]}
